  "hypothesis": "Integrating SoA storage (B) with NEON SIMD distance computation, max-heap top-k selection (A), OpenMP parallelization over groups with per-thread heaps and guided scheduling (C), plus fixing the critical bug where local_size was reset for each group instead of accumulated across a thread's assigned groups, will yield a correct program that matches baseline output exactly by using qsort-based tie-breaking identical to the original.",
